Guides should solve one concrete job at a time.

Start with the included [Workflow](/docs/guides/workflow). It shows a useful shape for steps, code, verification, and expected output without pretending to document your final product.

Keep a guide when it helps a reader finish a real task. Delete it when the product no longer works that way.
